# Arquitectura GoodLife Android

> Referencia completa: `docs/ARCHITECTURE_GUIDE.md`

## Regla de Dependencia (Clean Architecture)

```
PRESENTATION → DOMAIN ← DATA
```

- ❌ Domain NO importa de Data ni Presentation
- ❌ UseCase NO importa Retrofit, Room, Compose
- ✅ Domain solo usa Kotlin puro + kotlinx

## Estructura de Pantallas (Patrón Owner)

```kotlin
// 1. Owner: Inyecta ViewModel + maneja side-effects
@Composable
fun FeatureScreenOwner(viewModel: FeatureViewModel = koinViewModel()) {
    val uiState by viewModel.uiState.collectAsStateWithLifecycle()
    FeatureContent(uiState = uiState, onAction = viewModel::onAction)
}

// 2. Content: UI pura sin dependencias
@Composable
private fun FeatureContent(uiState: FeatureUiState, onAction: (FeatureUiAction) -> Unit)

// 3. UiState: @Stable sealed interface
@Stable
sealed interface FeatureUiState {
    data object Loading : FeatureUiState
    data class Content(...) : FeatureUiState
}

// 4. UiAction: @Stable sealed interface
@Stable  
sealed interface FeatureUiAction {
    data class OnFieldChange(val value: String) : FeatureUiAction
    data object OnButtonClick : FeatureUiAction
}
```

## Reglas KMP-Ready

```kotlin
// ❌ INCORRECTO - Dispatcher hardcodeado
viewModelScope.launch(Dispatchers.IO) { }

// ✅ CORRECTO - DispatcherProvider inyectado
class FeatureViewModel(
    private val dispatcherProvider: DispatcherProvider
) : ViewModel() {
    fun doWork() = viewModelScope.launch(dispatcherProvider.io) { }
}
```

- Interfaces en `domain/`, implementaciones en `platform/` o `data/`
- Usar `Result<T>` para operaciones que pueden fallar
- Modelos de Domain: Kotlin puro, sin Android imports

## Nomenclatura

| Elemento | Patrón | Ejemplo |
|----------|--------|---------|
| Screen Owner | `[Feature]ScreenOwner` | `LoginScreenOwner` |
| Content | `[Feature]Content` | `LoginContent` |
| ViewModel | `[Feature]ViewModel` | `LoginViewModel` |
| UiState | `[Feature]UiState` | `LoginUiState` |
| UiAction | `[Feature]UiAction` | `LoginUiAction` |
| UseCase | `[Verbo][Sustantivo]UseCase` | `ValidateEmailUseCase` |
| Repository | `[Domain]Repository` (interface) | `AuthRepository` |
| RepositoryImpl | `[Domain]RepositoryImpl` | `AuthRepositoryImpl` |

## Componentes Reutilizables

```kotlin
// Params + Component pattern
data class ButtonParams(val text: String, val enabled: Boolean = true)

@Composable
fun ButtonComponent(
    params: ButtonParams,
    onClick: () -> Unit,
    modifier: Modifier = Modifier
)
```

## Navegación

- **App-level** (Login→Main): `ComposeNavigationController` + SharedFlow
- **Tab-level** (Home↔Settings): `NavHostController` directo
- SharedFlow para eventos one-shot (evita re-navegación al rotar)
